{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>宏福苑大火將近一周年，現場附近的廣福休憩處地上近日貼上黃黑色膠紙。對於市民能否於該處悼念。保安局長鄧炳強表示，任何合法活動都會容許，提醒悼念之餘，要留意是否有人煽動參與違法行為，執勤人員也會在可行範圍提供協助。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.710158+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:48:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:40.412863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:24.099734+00:00","content_hash":"52d43510b0b06524f76ba9113f9a7a9739aae90f9522189fd4294735369c58f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}